{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15216220","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15216220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1521622001:0":{"text":"투타 마을에 도착했어요.","source_cn":"我们到了。图塔镇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC21E3F1F8B9F94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521622002:0":{"text":"투타 마을이... 이렇게 변해 버리다니...","source_cn":"图塔镇……居然变成了这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8073811C191D39B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521622003:0":{"text":"왜... 어째서...\n신이시여! 어째서 당신의 신도를 이런 식으로 대하시는 겁니까...?!","source_cn":"为什么……为什么……\\n神啊，您为什么要这样对待您的信...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87D1CB554B43EF79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521622004:0":{"text":"아버지와 어머니... 집... 친구들까지... 전부 다 사라져 버렸어!!","source_cn":"我老爹老娘……我的家……我的朋友们……全都没了！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA16FED1A0792D7CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521622005:0":{"text":"폐허로 된 투타 마을을 본 베르너는 얼굴을 가리며 오열했다.","source_cn":"维尔纳面对着图塔镇的废墟，掩面痛哭起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x859AB3248700804A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521622006:0":{"text":"그리고 한참이 지나서야 다시 몸을 일으켰다.","source_cn":"好一阵子之后，他才重新直起身来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x855315C8D40E25A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521622007:0":{"text":"아버지는... 어디에 계시나요? 아버지를 만나봐야겠어요...","source_cn":"我老爹……他在哪？我要去见他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2576E8D996A93190","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521622008:0":{"text":"저희가 데려다줄게요.","source_cn":"我们带你去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BB7F10BEDB1BCDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:加拉":{"text":"갈라","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维尔纳":{"text":"베르너","source":"维尔纳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}